(6401446, 949346, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wonderful capture, great light in what was probably difficult circumstances. In fact if this is a public performance I am surprised you were allowed to take photos.<br/> <br/>But, and it''s a big but, I don''t see how the square crop adds anything to this photo. Maybe if you had placed the performer in the center of the frame it would work a bit better. As it is now it''s a bit tight on the bottom.</td>', 'I think this is a wonderful capture, great light in what was probably difficult circumstances. In fact if this is a public performance I am surprised you were allowed to take photos. But, and it''s a big but, I don''t see how the square crop adds anything to this photo. Maybe if you had placed the performer in the center of the frame it would work a bit better. As it is now it''s a bit tight on the bottom.', '2011-05-02 10:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
