(6402664, 948670, 67152, '<td valign="top">the shapes of light pull us around the image in a dizzy-ing manner (and that is a fantatic thing).  The round shape of the man''s head balances the drain cover, the triangle of light reaching out in the darkness on the floor and wall is balanced by the trangles from the sky and trees beyond, the rectangle of path provides a place for the rectangle of the person walking.  This is just glorious!</td>', 'the shapes of light pull us around the image in a dizzy-ing manner (and that is a fantatic thing).  The round shape of the man''s head balances the drain cover, the triangle of light reaching out in the darkness on the floor and wall is balanced by the trangles from the sky and trees beyond, the rectangle of path provides a place for the rectangle of the person walking.  This is just glorious!', '2011-05-03 09:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
