(6403345, 949391, 124815, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha! Well, make a copy and give it to your ophthalmologist. And he will say: no, it''s perfectly true for a person suffering from distortion of view! Don''t we all have it in the big cities? (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=10553" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">penny</a>?)</td>', 'Ha, ha! Well, make a copy and give it to your ophthalmologist. And he will say: no, it''s perfectly true for a person suffering from distortion of view! Don''t we all have it in the big cities? ( penny?)', '2011-05-03 23:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
