(6405615, 948144, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is great. I''m a sucker for natural framing and this is perfect for this challenge. Centered composition as well with the tree, and the stream leading the viewer into the photo to the tree and to find the other interesting bits, such as the tufts of grass and sections of fence. Composition is really well thought out.<br/> <br/>It also has a wonderful hue to it. That late afternoon sun that''s golden but blinding and hard to capture while exposing properly. Nicely done.<br/> <br/>Certainly one of the better thought out photos for this challenge, and just pleasing in every way regardless.</td>', 'This is great. I''m a sucker for natural framing and this is perfect for this challenge. Centered composition as well with the tree, and the stream leading the viewer into the photo to the tree and to find the other interesting bits, such as the tufts of grass and sections of fence. Composition is really well thought out. It also has a wonderful hue to it. That late afternoon sun that''s golden but blinding and hard to capture while exposing properly. Nicely done. Certainly one of the better thought out photos for this challenge, and just pleasing in every way regardless.', '2011-05-06 10:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
