(6405765, 948830, 117534, '<td valign="top">I''m betting you get crushed for the major topaz''d effect, but myself personaly I really like it in this one. Brings out the many colorful stuff you tend to overlook in an old garage... So my humble opinion is Well Done!</td>', 'I''m betting you get crushed for the major topaz''d effect, but myself personaly I really like it in this one. Brings out the many colorful stuff you tend to overlook in an old garage... So my humble opinion is Well Done!', '2011-05-06 15:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
