(6405771, 949382, 117534, '<td valign="top">This is my Fav (kinda partial to horse photos) but regardless of that, the flow and positon is just perfect, and I know from personal experience it''s NOT easy to get a white/gray horse with out blow out... I looked at this a million times trying to figure out how you got the red background and suddenly today slapped myself ... duhhhh it''s a red barn... Excellent</td>', 'This is my Fav (kinda partial to horse photos) but regardless of that, the flow and positon is just perfect, and I know from personal experience it''s NOT easy to get a white/gray horse with out blow out... I looked at this a million times trying to figure out how you got the red background and suddenly today slapped myself ... duhhhh it''s a red barn... Excellent', '2011-05-06 15:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
