(6406001, 948578, 39057, '<td valign="top">I changed my vote several times on this. However, it is at a 6 now and I think that is were it will finish. I have some more to vote on so I still may change. <br/> <br/>I like:<br/> <br/>The blurred backgound<br/>The texture on the neck and chest<br/>The focus of the twigs and plants in front of the animal<br/>The eye looking at the camera<br/> <br/>Things to work on:<br/> <br/>Distracting blurred rock in the foreground<br/>The harsh mid-day lighting<br/>The 1/2 shadow  1/2 light on the face and nose<br/>The SLIGHTLY blown highlights on the animals back<br/>The broken horns</td>', 'I changed my vote several times on this. However, it is at a 6 now and I think that is were it will finish. I have some more to vote on so I still may change.  I like: The blurred backgoundThe texture on the neck and chestThe focus of the twigs and plants in front of the animalThe eye looking at the camera Things to work on: Distracting blurred rock in the foregroundThe harsh mid-day lightingThe 1/2 shadow  1/2 light on the face and noseThe SLIGHTLY blown highlights on the animals backThe broken horns', '2011-05-06 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
