(6408116, 949350, 55283, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ScooterMcNutty:</b></div><hr/><i> this was one of my favorites! &gt;.&lt; really dissapointed it didn''t do better! gave you your 10 :P </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks :)<br/>I''m surprised it did this well, considering it started at 3 and hung out in the 4s for a while before breaking 6 for a day or two. There''s a lot of negative space and no singular focal point. I figured 5.0 going in. It was a fun ride and landed on my profile. I''m not disappointed in the least.</td>', 'Originally posted by ScooterMcNutty: this was one of my favorites! >.< really dissapointed it didn''t do better! gave you your 10 :P  Thanks :)I''m surprised it did this well, considering it started at 3 and hung out in the 4s for a while before breaking 6 for a day or two. There''s a lot of negative space and no singular focal point. I figured 5.0 going in. It was a fun ride and landed on my profile. I''m not disappointed in the least.', '2011-05-09 01:21:54.000000', NULL, 0),
