(6409932, 948541, 39057, '<td valign="top">LOL...I can''t believe that after you posted that it wasn''t square the image fell by a point ! You do know that voters must have linked you with your other great surf image along with the posts in the forums....yikes !!!!  Watch what you say in there for now on ! :-)<br/> <br/>These are some great shots and I hope to see more.<br/> <br/>On the square issue....this one looked just as square as any. To measure pixels is insane. If you''re going to measure this and vote down then you should ONLY do so if you are going to measure ALL SHOTS IN THE CHALLENGE.</td>', 'LOL...I can''t believe that after you posted that it wasn''t square the image fell by a point ! You do know that voters must have linked you with your other great surf image along with the posts in the forums....yikes !!!!  Watch what you say in there for now on ! :-) These are some great shots and I hope to see more. On the square issue....this one looked just as square as any. To measure pixels is insane. If you''re going to measure this and vote down then you should ONLY do so if you are going to measure ALL SHOTS IN THE CHALLENGE.', '2011-05-11 00:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
