(6431816, 949092, 12611, '<td valign="top">A square crop is certainly no easy task in a landscape; the smoke and buildings help but there is a clarity here that is stunning; again a nice use of a crimson foreground-leading the eye on diagonals to one of many focal points. The utter giant centered darkness of the sky may be a distraction to some, but I feel it adds to the nature of the drama.</td>', 'A square crop is certainly no easy task in a landscape; the smoke and buildings help but there is a clarity here that is stunning; again a nice use of a crimson foreground-leading the eye on diagonals to one of many focal points. The utter giant centered darkness of the sky may be a distraction to some, but I feel it adds to the nature of the drama.', '2011-06-02 12:18:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6431819, 949393, 12611, '<td valign="top">This was so good- how did this not win. Holy crap the detail is amazing, the composition, the placement of subject, background, etc. all stunning. excellent work.</td>', 'This was so good- how did this not win. Holy crap the detail is amazing, the composition, the placement of subject, background, etc. all stunning. excellent work.', '2011-06-02 12:20:24.000000', NULL, 0),
